      "id": 30,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [50, 1550],
      "size": [800, 300],
      "title": "CarWash AnimateDiff Video Workflow",
      "properties": {
        "text": "CARWASH VIDEO GENERATION WORKFLOW\n=====================================\n\nThis workflow generates temporally-coherent VIDEO from Houdini AOVs.\n\nINPUTS FROM HOUDINI:\n- Depth video/sequence: Rendered depth pass as MP4 or EXR sequence\n- Normal video/sequence: Rendered normal pass as MP4 or EXR sequence\n- Style reference: Single frame defining the look\n\nKEY COMPONENTS:\n1. AnimateDiff: Motion-aware diffusion (no flickering!)\n2. TemporalNet ControlNet: Maintains structure across frames\n3. IP-Adapter: Style consistency across all frames\n4. Context Options: Handles long videos via sliding window\n\nOUTPUTS:\n- MP4 video file (for preview)\n- Frame sequence (for Houdini composite)\n\nREQUIRED MODELS:\n- mm_sd_v15_v2.ckpt (AnimateDiff motion model)\n- control_v11f1p_sd15_depth.pth\n- control_v11p_sd15_normalbae.pth\n- ip-adapter-plus_sd15.bin\n- Any SD 1.5 checkpoint\n\nVIDEO LENGTH:\n- 16-24 frames per batch (context window)\n- Longer videos use sliding window with overlap"
      }
    }
  ],
